# =============================================================================
# NovaOS - Package list for x86_64 ISO build
# Base: Arch Linux + KDE Plasma 6 + NovaOS custom theme
# Target: Bootable live ISO with installer; broad HW support (AMD, NVIDIA,
#         Intel 2009+, all modern CPUs); lightweight but full-featured.
# =============================================================================

